  "description": "If there’s one thing Do Haejoo loves more than her job, it’s handsome men. But after a breakup and a career blunder that lands her a week off, her luck turns around when she finds a mysterious flyer for a cleaning service exclusively for women. The cleaner who shows up is not only competent—he's drop-dead gorgeous and awakens her dull world with his special services. Is this the beginning of Haejoo's very own love story or a messy temptation that's too hot to handle?\n\n(Source: Tapas)",
